<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 4.50 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 4.50 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Friday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 4.50 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Nov 26			3,300</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Nov		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to Nov 21			   7,181</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    4,498</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 240</p>
